            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A wireless device initiates a small data transmissions (SDT) procedure in a non-connected state. During the SDT procedure, a first uplink signal is transmitted based on a first transmission power. The first transmission power is determined based on: an initial value of a first power control adjustment state, and one or more transmit power control command values received based on the initiating.</p>
            </abstract>
